{
  "name": "Record",
  "comment": "Writes run.txt beside this goal: a run stopped at its save inside Sub, for FreshAppGoesOn.test.goal to resume\nin an app of its own. Not a test. Run it again when this goal or Sub changes (the resume then answers 409, the goal's\nhash changed), from test/: plang plan/snapshot/module/snapshot/resume/FreshAppGoesOn/Record.goal",
